@startuml
state Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state OutOfService
state RemovedFromOperations

[*]->Order:Delivery
Arrival-->Preparation:Arrival
Preparation-->Operations:ConditionSchedule
Operations-->Maintenance:NoMoreFlightsOrMaintenanceRequired
Maintenance-->Preparation:ReadyForOperations
Maintenance-->OutOfService:UnavailableForUse
RemovedFromOperations<--Operations:PermanentlyWithdrawn

@enduml
